<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Staging table</title>
    <style>
        h3 { ${REGULAR_LARGE_FONT_STYLE} }
        body { ${REGULAR_FONT_STYLE} }
        code { ${MONOSPACE_FONT_STYLE} }
        h3 code { font-size: inherit; }
        p { margin-top:0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body style="width: 300px">
    <h3>Data Source</h3>
    <p>Data source used for generating vector embeddings. Choose where the content will be loaded from.</p>
    <br>
    <p>Supported sources:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><u>File system</u> – Select one or more files from your local file system</li>
        <li><u>Database tables</u> – Specify one or more tables from your database</li>
        <li><u>SELECT statement</u> – Provide a SELECT statement that returns the text content to be embedded</li>
    </ul>
</body>
</html>


